# Experiment 1 — LED Blink Using Arduino UNO

## Aim

To study the working of a microcontroller and perform LED blinking using Arduino UNO.

## Apparatus Required

* Arduino UNO
* LED
* 220Ω Resistor
* Breadboard
* Jumper Wires
* USB Cable

## Pin Description

| Arduino Pin | Component    |
| ----------- | ------------ |
| Pin 13      | LED Positive |
| GND         | LED Negative |

## Connection Diagram

```text id="9qdbjo"
Arduino Pin 13 ---- 220Ω Resistor ---- LED (+)

LED (-) ------------------------------ GND
```

## Program

```cpp
void setup() {
  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {

  digitalWrite(13, HIGH);
  delay(1000);

  digitalWrite(13, LOW);
  delay(1000);
}
```

