# Experiment 2 — LM35 Temperature Sensor

## Aim

To collect sensor data and transfer through serial communication.

## Apparatus Required

* Arduino UNO
* LM35 Sensor
* Breadboard
* Jumper Wires
* USB Cable

## Pin Description

| LM35 Pin | Arduino UNO |
| -------- | ----------- |
| VCC      | 5V          |
| OUT      | A0          |
| GND      | GND         |

## Connection Diagram

```text id="0bg7ij"
LM35 VCC ---- Arduino 5V

LM35 OUT ---- Arduino A0

LM35 GND ---- Arduino GND
```

## Program

```cpp
int sensorPin = A0;

void setup() {

  Serial.begin(9600);
}

void loop() {

  int value = analogRead(sensorPin);

  float voltage = value * (5.0 / 1023.0);

  float temp = voltage * 100;

  Serial.println(temp);

  delay(1000);
}
```

