# Experiment 5 — Push Button with LED/Buzzer

## Aim

To interface push button with Arduino UNO and control LED/Buzzer.

## Apparatus Required

* Arduino UNO
* Push Button
* LED/Buzzer
* 220Ω Resistor
* Breadboard
* Jumper Wires

## Pin Description

| Component   | Arduino Pin |
| ----------- | ----------- |
| Push Button | Pin 2       |
| LED/Buzzer  | Pin 3       |

## Connection Diagram

```text id="25ab1n"
Push Button ------- Pin 2

LED/Buzzer -------- Pin 3

Common GND -------- Arduino GND
```

## Program

```cpp
const int buttonPin = 2;
const int ledPin = 3;

void setup() {

  pinMode(buttonPin, INPUT);
  pinMode(ledPin, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {

  int buttonState = digitalRead(buttonPin);

  if (buttonState == HIGH) {

    digitalWrite(ledPin, HIGH);
    delay(300);

    digitalWrite(ledPin, LOW);
    delay(300);

  } else {

    digitalWrite(ledPin, LOW);
  }
}
```

