# Experiment 12 — Temperature Sensor using Raspberry Pi

## Aim

To collect temperature and humidity data using DHT11 sensor.

## Apparatus Required

* Raspberry Pi 5
* DHT11 Sensor
* Jumper Wires

## Pin Description

| Raspberry Pi Physical Pin | GPIO  | DHT11 Pin |
| ------------------------- | ----- | --------- |
| Pin 1                     | 3.3V  | VCC       |
| Pin 7                     | GPIO4 | DATA      |
| Pin 6                     | GND   | GND       |

## Connection Diagram

```text id="96r8c9"
Raspberry Pi Pin 1 (3.3V) ---- DHT11 VCC

Raspberry Pi Pin 7 (GPIO4) --- DHT11 DATA

Raspberry Pi Pin 6 (GND) ----- DHT11 GND
```

## Program

```python id="q9v7kb"
import adafruit_dht
import board
import time

dht_device = adafruit_dht.DHT11(board.D4)

while True:

    try:

        temp = dht_device.temperature
        humi = dht_device.humidity

        print(f"Temperature: {temp}°C")
        print(f"Humidity: {humi}%")

    except RuntimeError as error:

        print(error.args[0])

    time.sleep(2)
}
```
